      "value": "On a very similar note, I feel like this text that displays on the QM and MM when inspecting a user should be more transparent about what kind of mutuals you have.\n\nIt currently feels very misleading to read \"VIew 53 mutuals\" only to realize we only have 3 mutual friends and 50 mutual groups.\n\nI feel like it should say something along the lines of \"View 53 Mutuals (3 Friends, 50 Groups)\"",
